$ Python standard library: select
@ select

`select` provides access to the following syscalls(?), if available:
  • `select()`
  • `poll()`
  • `epoll()`
  • `kqueue()` (most BSD)
  • `devpoll()` (Solaris and derivatives)

On Windows, it works for sockets only.

